<title>ITALY: Italy's Recordati Q1 97 turnover in line.</title>
<headline>Italy's Recordati Q1 97 turnover in line.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian pharmaceutical group Recordati said consolidated net sales in the first quarter of 1997 totalled 92.6 billion lire, in line with the same 1996 period.</p>
<p>The company posted 1996 net profit of 19.6 billion lire against 18.3 billion in 1995 on turnover of 354.1 billion lire against 325.4 billion.</p>
<p>The company paid an unchanged ordinary dividend of 300 lire.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
